 "text": "Hey, how are you holding up? Ask to have it right away and give clear reason, being hungry is enough. You' welcome. It works wonders. Asking right after it' cooked is best, though you can also say you noticed thing right at the start. Most will keep it warm for a short break, and the rare one throws it out rarely does. It' worth try. Being honest is the key. being hungry or a bit bloated is much faster than waiting. If the food is genuinely spoiled, most places will re order it without grumbling.",
